Description: Provides generic functions for routine tasks required to run OMOP-CDM studies.
  In addition to testing these recurring methods, studyGenerics aims to centralise
  collaboration and speed up the development of these types of projects. The optional
  ROhdsiWebApi package is available from <https://github.com/OHDSI/ROhdsiWebApi>.
